    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2672" root="بصل" body-key="b">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبْصِيلٌ</span></b>  The act of <i>stripping,</i> or <i>divesting;</i>
[<i>like as when one strips an onion</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَصَلَة</span>) <i>of its
coats;</i>] (K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَصُّلٌ</span></b> . (Fr, K.) You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَصَّلْتُ الرَّجُلَ عِنْ ثِيَابِهِ</span> [and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَصَّلْتُهُ</span></b> ] <i>I stripped
the man of his clothes.</i> (TA.)

